  "reflectionText": "Paul wrote: present your bodies a living sacrifice, holy, acceptable to God. Do not be conformed to this world, but be transformed by the renewing of your mind. Bless those who persecute you. Overcome evil with good. What is it to live a life that is the offering itself, daily set on the altar without being consumed?"
